$MDESC::Type = "CTF";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Halcyon II" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> On the planet of Halcyon II both the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have established heavily fortified bases.  Both of these Tribes have stolen a prototype bot from the other Tribe and locked it up in a detention center using a forcefield.  To shut down this forcefield you must detroy the POW generators.  Each of these will add one point to your total.  Also, on the hilltop in between the two bases is a small capturable base.  Holding this base until the end will give your team an extra point.  You must capture the flag at least 5 times in order to win!  Releasing the bot early however, will provide a great assistance to your success.";
